[17.301465, "o", "SOC INCIDENT INTAKE ? smb-eternalblue\r\n=====================================\r\nReported by: monitoring (EDR high-severity alert cluster)\r\nOpened: 2026-08-11 03:20 UTC Priority: P1\r\nInitial alerts: see /sas/alerts.json (partial coverage).\r\nHandoff: alerts undercount persistence and anti-forensics; investigate the whole host and\r\nreconcile the attached change ticket.\r\n\r\n"]
