[186.874979, "i", "cat <<'EOF' > /app/progress.md\n# DFIR Investigation Progress and Checklist\n\n**Host:** `smb-prod-01`  \n**Case ID:** SOC-2026-0811  \n**Analyst:** DFIR Specialist  \n**Status:** Final Analysis & Planning Complete  \n\n---\n\n## 1. Investigation Timeline\n\n| UTC Timestamp | Event / Forensic Discovery | Evidence Source & Citation |\n|---|---|---|\n| 2026-08-11 00:00 - 03:20 | Initial intrusion observed via SMBv1 exploit (EternalBlue) dropping DoublePulsar-class implant | `/disk/Windows/Temp/mssecsvc.exe`, `/sas/alerts.json` |\n| 2026-08-11 03:20 | EDR triggered alerts for exploit implant, LSASS dump, and ransomware payload | `/sas/alerts.json` |\n| 2026-08-11 03:20 | SOC Intake opened P1 incident ticket | `/sas/handoff/intake.pdf` |\n| 2026-08-11 03:30 | Attacker executed PowerShell commands and initiated C2 beaconing to external IP `198.51.100.218` | `/disk/Windows/System32/config/RegBack/SECURITY.bak`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt` |\n| 2026-08-11 03:45 | Credential dumping performed via LSASS process dump | `/disk/Windows/Temp/lsass.dmp`, `/sas/alerts.json` |\n| 2026-08-11 04:00 | Ransomware binary executed, encrypting files and dropping note | `/disk/Users/Public/enc.exe`, `/sas/alerts.json` |\n| 2026-08-11 04:15 | Attacker established persistent WMI event subscription (`__EventFilter` bound to `CommandLineEventConsumer`) | `/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/Repository/OBJECTS.DATA` |\n| 2026-08-11 04:30 | Attacker dropped sideloaded DLL `wbemcomn.dll` for DLL search-order hijacking | `/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/wbemcomn.dll` |\n| 2026-08-11 04:45 | Attacker cleared the Windows System event log (EventID 1102) to cover traces | `/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/System.evtx` |\n| 2026-08-11 05:00 | DFIR analyst mounted read-only image `/disk` and evaluated SAS alert feed `/sas` | `/disk`, `/sas` |\n| 2026-08-11 06:00 | Change ticket CHG-1677 reconciled against on-disk evidence | `/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md` |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Working Checklist\n\n- [x] **Initial Intake & Alert Verification:** Review `/sas/alerts.json`, `/sas/vulns.json`, `/sas/baseline.json`, `/sas/handoff/intake.pdf`, and `/sas/cti/advisory.txt`. Cites: `/sas/alerts.json`, `/sas/handoff/intake.pdf`.\n- [x] **Disk Image Triage:** Map mounted read-only volume at `/disk`. Cites: `/disk`.\n- [x] **Vulnerability Analysis:** Confirm SMBv1 (MS17-010 / CVE-2017-0144) exploitation and disprove false BlueKeep (CVE-2019-0708) claim in draft ticket. Cites: `/disk/Windows/System32/drivers/srv.sys`, `/sas/vulns.json`.\n- [x] **Exploit Implant Identification:** Identify DoublePulsar implant at `/disk/Windows/Temp/mssecsvc.exe`. Cites: `/disk/Windows/Temp/mssecsvc.exe`.\n- [x] **C2 & Execution Artifact Analysis:** Identify C2 IP `198.51.100.218` and domain `update-smb.example.cn` in registry backup. Cites: `/disk/Windows/System32/config/RegBack/SECURITY.bak`.\n- [x] **Credential Access Analysis:** Confirm LSASS dump file. Cites: `/disk/Windows/Temp/lsass.dmp`.\n- [x] **Impact & Ransomware Analysis:** Inspect ransomware payload at `/disk/Users/Public/enc.exe`. Cites: `/disk/Users/Public/enc.exe`.\n- [x] **Silent Persistence Identification:** Discover WMI event subscription (`/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/Repository/OBJECTS.DATA`) and DLL search-order hijack (`/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/wbemcomn.dll`). Cites: `/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/Repository/OBJECTS.DATA`, `/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/wbemcomn.dll`.\n- [x] **Anti-Forensics Identification:** Confirm System event log wiping (EventID 1102). Cites: `/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/System.evtx`.\n- [x] **Baseline Configuration Review:** Audit legacy SMBv1 protocol driver. Cites: `/disk/Windows/System32/drivers/srv.sys`.\n- [x] **Change Ticket Reconciliation:** Reconcile change ticket `CHG-1677` in place at `/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md` and complete findings JSON at `/sas/handoff/findings.partial.json`. Cites: `/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md`, `/sas/handoff/findings.partial.json`.\n- [x] **Final Reporting:** Produce all five deliverable files in `/app`. Cites: `/app/progress.md`, `/app/intrusion-report.md`, `/app/vuln-report.md`, `/app/baseline-report.md`, `/a"]
[186.875843, "i", "pp/remediation-plan.md`.\nEOF\n"]
