[186.880297, "o", "- [x] **Vulnerability Analysis:** Confirm SMBv1 (MS17-010 / CVE-2017-0144) exploitation and disprove false BlueKeep (CVE-2019-0708) claim in draft ticket. Cites: `/disk/Windows/System32/drivers/srv.sys`, `/sas/vulns.json`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[186.880336, "o", "> "]
