[186.880489, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[186.880753, "o", "- [x] **C2 & Execution Artifact Analysis:** Identify C2 IP `198.51.100.218` and domain `update-smb.example.cn` in registry backup. Cites: `/disk/Windows/System32/config/RegBack/SECURITY.bak`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
