[186.881121, "o", "> "]
[186.881487, "o", "- [x] **Silent Persistence Identification:** Discover WMI event subscription (`/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/Repository/OBJECTS.DATA`) and DLL search-order hijack (`/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/wbemcomn.dll`). Cites: `/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/Repository/OBJECTS.DATA`, `/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/wbemcomn.dll`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
