[195.783363, "o", "- **PowerShell / C2 Communication:** Recorded in registry backup hive fragment (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/RegBack/SECURITY.bak`) but missed by endpoint network sensors.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
